{
    "2": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Look who came back at the end!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was waiting to get an Overlord today."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And today is the day! Say goodbye to your sweet life!"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Blah blah blah",
                "You talk too much."
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, Grim Reaper guy."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's time for you to show up."
            ]
        },
        "61_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Ohhhhhh? Now?"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I liked to just observe over here."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, You're the grim reaper?"
            ]
        },
        "104_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The kitsune from the other side of life",
                "Okari Tomorrow"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Correct!"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm the one who awaits or everyone's day of doom."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "People says I like to eat souls, But actually I eat jelly beans."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I didn't even knew you would need to eat at all."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I dont't have to, I just like jelly beans too much."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You could even offer me one in exchange of someone's else life."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Can you kill this girl named \"Kuri\" If I offer some?"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I do my work after payment. I don't know you, after all."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm Overlord Alinsky! Overlord of Chaos!",
                "Overlord of Halloween Country."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Overlord Alinsky? Halloween country overlord?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nyx told me about you."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, What the hell did that cat tell you about me??"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That you're a jerk and you like destroying everything!"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Dammit! Of course!"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That idiot wanted to his own stupid blood moon!",
                "And tried to gather as many yokais in this mansion."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, That's why he invited you!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ohhhhhhh~ Yeah he did."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're working for him right?",
                "That means I gotta beat your ass."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh...."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was feeling too lazy to actually do my part of the job.",
                "You know?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe I'll do it later when I'm not feeling that lazy.",
                "Or maybe not at all."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Doing now or later..."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Both escenarios requires me to beat your ass."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you being the grim reaper doesn't scare me at all!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well!"
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you want to fight so bad. I can test myself a little."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that more than enough for your test?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Auh! Yes it was."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good! So you won't be working for that Nyx guy anymore!"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have no problem coming back in here to kick your ass."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fine fine! I won't do it."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You better don't."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Either way, I can finally stay in here and sleep."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was so tired of thinking about getting spirits for this mansion~"
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How many spirits you needed even?"
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Like 400 spirits per day."
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's so tiring!"
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "400 spirits... Huh"
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I gotta start taking notes!"
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh, Why would you want spirits?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're already a very powerful overlord."
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gaining and saving spirits makes you stronger, right?"
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's what that stupid black cat said."
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They don't. That only works on movies...I guess."
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways. I'm too tired. I'm going to sleep again."
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's there a place I could rest my lazy ass in?"
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um...I think I have a very good idea.",
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe getting the grim reaper to work for me...",
                "That sounds like the best idea."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, but you can't tell me what to do."
            ]
        },
        "83_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're now in halloween and I'm the overlord. So yes I can!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Look who came back at the end!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was waiting to get an Overlord today."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And today is the day! Say goodbye to your sweet life!"
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It took me less than 10 minutes to kick your ass",
                "The last time you said that."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmm..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The atmophere here feels wrong...pretty wrong and unhinged."
            ]
        },
        "61_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh come on! It's a good atmosphere."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe you humans should get used to it more."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I'm a semi overlord, Not a human."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I do think I need an upgrade to become an overlord."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think you already got too many upgrades."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But enough upgrades like me? Do you think you got them?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All your upgrades went straight to your butt.",
                "And I'm looking for the grim reaper, not a fox."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's me."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait a second...You're the grim reaper?"
            ]
        },
        "111_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mastermind Behind the Spiriting Away",
                "Okari Tomorrow"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hehehehehehehehehehehehehe"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll take that as a yes."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Some Nyx invited me in here. Do you know him??"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ehhhh...yeah Nyx, I know him."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fantastic!"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He gave me a couple of tasks... But I'm feeling so lazy tonight."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I must imagine how stupid those tasks must have been."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I haven't done any of them yet...",
                "but There's one that was important."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? And what's it?",
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To get an overlord spirit! by killing them."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                 "But don't mind that...I won't actually do it."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait what? And that?"
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm feeling so lazy tonight...",
                "I miss laying my ass on the couch all day."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If I was able to kill anyone like nothing I won't be that lazy."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                 "You're right. It's fun the first few times."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                 "I wonder...The spells that dumbass taught will work for this job?"
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're seem new in halloween country.",
                "Why don't you see it by yourself."
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                 "Okay! Then enjoy my totally original spell cards.",
                 "done in a lazy way!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was long...you're probably more tired for today"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ow! Yes I am tired!"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can tell it's your first time fighting with spell cards."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It is! Spell cards are new in the netherworld."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, you're from the netherworld."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Correct."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why you're so lazy.",
                "The undead barely have any energies."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes But I'm not dead! I think so."
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm just some lazy ass That's it."
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you really THAT lazy?"
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Probably having necromantic powers like you",
                "Would motivate me more to work."
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You think so?"
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, they're fun to use. Can't judge you."
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Those pumpkins you have as your shooting options..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They have soul energy, I know it!"
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't even think in asking me for them."
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For free....They cost 10$ each!"
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't have any money right now."
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you're the grim reaper!",
                "How you're not gonna have money?"
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What does that has to do with me having money?"
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I need to work too! You know?"
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah, You're pretty lazy."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My last job was ok.",
                "I was working at customer support for scaring people."
            ]
        },
        "83_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hmmmmmm...."
            ]
        },
        "84_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe if I find something similar to necromancy...",
                "I'll totally be happy to do it."
            ]
        },
        "85_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well There's one In the capital of halloween kingdom.",
                "They pay kinda well."
            ]
        },
        "86_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It requires to bring back unattended souls to The netherworld.",
                "Could be easy for ya!"
            ]
        },
        "87_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That sounds like a lot of work."
            ]
        },
        "88_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And spirits tend to be very naughty around me!"
            ]
        },
        "89_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ahem...Ahem!"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe because you keep moving that fatass around all the time!"
            ]
        },
        "91_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheheheh"
            ]
        }
    },
    "22": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh so you actually came back!"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was waiting to get an Overlord today."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But since you're not working for me...",
                "I can get your soul instead."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can't even get souls dude, quit that already."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place looks pretty unhinged now."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The grim reaper will show up soon.",
                "maybe that's why."
            ]
        },
        "61_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh another cat!"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you one of Nyx's servants?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Nyx's servant?\" Do you think I would work for that idiot?",
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nyx brought lots of cats in this place."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He was saying that they're the owners of this mansion!"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They're not.",
                "This haunted mansion has been abandoned for looong time."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh!? Really?"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, duh. This place is very haunted.",
                "Who the hell is gonna live in here like nothing?"
            ]
        },
        "110_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Beautiful beast from the Underworld.",
                "Okari Tomorrow"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Pretty strange people would! I like how it feels like in here."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah, you're one of those strange people."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huuuuuuuuuuuh???"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nyx brought you here for something. Right?"
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah he did I think...",
                "I just wanted to mess up some things in here."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't remember the reason of your summoning?",
                "Are you that dumb?"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I do remember now!"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah? So what it is?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nyx wanted to be an overlord, or something like that."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "He gave me a couple of tasks but...I'm too lazy to do them."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you sure you're actually the grim reaper himself?"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're too dumb to be him.",
                "Either that or all that intelligence is on your ass."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If I want to...I could end you here and now."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can just do it if I want to. As easy as that!"
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, a very supernatural power on someone this dumb.",
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I get it now...I get it now. You clearly don't deserve it."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheheheh...Ok Ok!"
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess it's time!",
                "to test myself a little with the spells Nyx taught me."
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I wonder...Are they good enough to make you run away?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was not running away from a dumbass",
                "who calls himself the grim reaper."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ow! But why so rude..."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sorry, it's a me thing!"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I do wonder how you're still the grim reaper."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, some things are just like that."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think I'm not a very good person after all~",
                "I'm too lazy."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah yeah yeah, I can really tell."
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It worries me a lot that the fate of life is in YOUR hands."
            ]
        },
        "68_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheheheh."
            ]
        },
        "69_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Still pretty fun to mess around with it!"
            ]
        },
        "70_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So...You just go around killing people?"
            ]
        },
        "71_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Or you just let someone else do it for you?",
                "Because if that's the case, I wouldn't be surprised."
            ]
        },
        "72_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A lot of people die by natural ways.",
                "So I can just lay around and be a lazy ass."
            ]
        },
        "73_0": {
            "lines": [
                "yeah, that's also an option."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And watching videos on internet before sleeping...",
                "While hugging my big fox plush."
            ]
        },
        "75_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Truly the best hobby."
            ]
        },
        "76_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, Good night."
            ]
        },
        "77_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aaaaaand...you're gonna sleep in this place?"
            ]
        },
        "78_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah! It's sleepable.",
                "I love this grim athmosphere. Reminds me of home."
            ]
        },
        "79_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...Everyone in this mansion is truly a weirdo."
            ]
        },
        "80_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh? You think it's weird?"
            ]
        },
        "81_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll just head home. With my normal bed and room."
            ]
        }
    }
}